CoincidentRootLoci -- A package for computations with coincident root loci
**************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package accompanies the paper On the algebraic boundaries among typical
ranks for real binary forms (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.08309 ) (see also
Algebraic boundaries among typical ranks for real binary forms of arbitrary
degree (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.01958 )). It provides some tools that
can be useful for working with symmetric tensors of dimension 2. Such tensors
are bijectively associated with homogeneous polynomials in two variables, which
are also called binary forms. One of the main methods is *note realrank:
realrank,, which uses QEPCAD (see
https://www.usna.edu/CS/qepcadweb/B/QEPCAD.html ) to compute the real rank of
binary forms defined over $\mathbb{Q}$.

